## E. Reply records

**The format**
- One record per line: a word saying what the record is, then `key=value` fields in a fixed order.
- A value is quoted with `interop::replyValue` when it holds a space, a quote or an `=`.
- Errors go to stderr as `error: <Code>: <message>`.

**Records**
```
gdal algorithm="raster hillshade" policy=safe seconds=0.017 cancelled=no
input arg=input source=surface|raster|file|drawing name=… id=… cell=… raster=WxH file="…"
scope arg=input matched=12 used=10 points=0 lines=4 polygons=6 skipped.text=2 skipped.heightless=0
output arg=output kind=raster|vector|file target=reference|layer|file|surface|selection id=… name=… layer=…
       created=… updated=… deleted=… raster=WxH file="…" driver=… persisted=yes|no
text lines=<n>         (then the n lines of output-string verbatim)
return code=<n>
warning text="…"
